- `/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/src/root.tsx` — app shell; imports `./global.css`, wraps `ConvexProvider > AuthProvider > PostHogProvider > RouterOutlet`, loads Google Fonts (Fraunces / Lora / DM Sans / Special Elite).
- Dev: `bun run dev` (concurrently runs `convex dev` + `vite --mode ssr`). Storybook at `bun run storybook`.

Qwik idioms in use: `component$`, `useStore`, `useSignal`, `PropFunction`, `onClick$`/`onInput$` handlers, `useVisibleTask$` (with `// eslint-disable-next-line qwik/no-use-visible-task` above each usage).

## 2. Modals / dialogs

**No Radix, no headless UI library — all custom.** The canonical shared component is:

- `/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/src/components/ui/themed-dialog.tsx` — `ThemedDialog`, the only reusable dialog. Story file: `/home/diogenes/Projects/twyne/src/components/ui/themed-dialog.stories.tsx`.

The pattern: early-return `if (!props.open) return null;`, a `fixed inset-0` scrim with `zIndex: "var(--z-modal)"` and `background: "rgba(20, 16, 10, 0.58)"`, backdrop click-to-close via `e.target === e.currentTarget`, inner panel with `class="folio w-full max-w-md p-5" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby=...`, buttons `btn-paper` (cancel) / `btn-press` (confirm), errors in `.error-slip`.

